rver, real price books, anything you could not drive and why). **Last line of STATUS, exactly one of:** `VERDICT: B663 pr112 b654/mps-draft-validation-walk-caps @ <sha7> <GO|GO WITH FINDINGS|NO GO> (round 1 of 2) on main <sha7>` (finding ids with severities on the line above; the line carries none of the words that name a landing) or `STOPPED: NEEDS TUESDAY` + ONE question.

