- Datasec / MPS Commercial Calculator only; if any output shows another client's material, stop reading it and disclose its shape without quoting. No deploy, `az`, Kudu, Entra, Graph, docker, ssh. **No HTTP to any hosted or production site or app host.** Network: the one fetch of Step 0, `gh api -X GET` under the project `GH_CONFIG_DIR`, Jira GET (any JQL begins `project = MPSCALC AND ( ... )` with the parentheses; credentials by name in-process, never printed), NuGet restore into your own homes. `gh run rerun`, `gh workflow run`, `gh api -X POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE` are forbidden. Never dismiss an alert. No decision-queue tool in any form, no scoreboard, no Artifact, Docs, mail, chat or publish tool.
